nt(args)\t\n\tvar n: float = args[0] if args.size() > 0 else 0\t\n\treturn n + 666\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23736745/new-project.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113139/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113139/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}